OL,3,GNEWSAYoung carers given chance to 'be
OL,4,Ajust children'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs children across the country make the
OL,7,Fmost of the final days of the summer
OL,8,Fholidays, many are spending their time
OL,9,Fplaying with friends, going on trips
OL,10,Fand enjoying a break from school.
OL,12,FBut for children like Sophia and
OL,13,FCharlie from Shropshire, the holidays
OL,14,Fhave also involved caring
OL,15,Fresponsibilities at home.
OL,17,FBoth eight-year-olds have attended a
OL,18,Fgroup which helps give young carers
OL,19,Ffree time to be "normal children."
